sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Fan
    participant p1 as Waiting Room
    participant p2 as Reservation API
    participant p3 as Seats DB
    participant p4 as Payment PSP
    participant p5 as Ticket Worker
    p0->>p1: Request admission
    p1->>p2: Rate-limited admission token
    p2->>p3: Conditional hold on available seat
    p3->>p2: Reservation token with expiry
    p2->>p4: Authorize before hold expiry
    p4->>p2: Payment result
    p2->>p3: Commit sold or release hold
    p2->>p5: Durable ticket issue event
    p5->>p0: Ticket or failure notice
